    },
    "start": "greeting",
    "auto_start": true,
    "target_level": 1,
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "greeting",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "expression": "smile",
        "text": "「坂口医生，昨天真的非常感谢您。」\n蓝发护士见到坂口，立刻从护士站后走出来。换下手术服以后，她的长发束在身后，神情也比昨天柔和得多。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "ask_who",
            "label": "你是？",
            "next": "who_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          },
          {
            "id": "mistake_patient",
            "label": "昨天手术室那个跑出来的患者？",
            "next": "patient_mistake_reply",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "who_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "expression": "worried",
        "text": "「啊……果然没认出来吗？」\n她有些不好意思地摸了摸发梢。\n「昨天我戴着手术帽和口罩，只来得及道歉。我是病房护士杉村弘子，也会协助手术室工作。」",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "accept_intro",
            "label": "原来是昨天那名护士",
            "next": "patient_update",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "patient_mistake_reply",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "expression": "surprised",
        "text": "「诶？不、不是！跑出来的不是我！」\n她下意识红着脸摆手，随后才意识到坂口是在打趣，困窘地抿了抿嘴。\n「我是后来向您道歉的护士，杉村弘子。平时主要负责病房，也会进手术室帮忙。」",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "apologize_tease",
            "label": "抱歉，只是换了制服一时没认出",
            "next": "patient_update",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "patient_update",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "text": "「昨天那位患者后来总算慢慢平静下来。我们重新确认了状况，后续手术也顺利完成了。」\n弘子轻轻松了口气。\n「她醒来以后还是很难为情，不过身体没有问题。那样闹了一场还能平安结束，已经是最好的结果了。」",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "glad_success",
            "label": "听到手术成功就好",
            "next": "work_talk",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "work_talk",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "expression": "smile",
        "text": "「嗯。以后在病房或门诊见到我，都可以直接叫我弘子。」\n她温和地笑了笑，又认真补充：\n「手术室需要人手时也请找我。器械和巡回的工作我都做过，不会给坂口医生添乱。」",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "welcome_hiroko",
            "label": "以后请多关照，杉村护士",
            "next": "@end",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": [
              "met_nurse_hiroko"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "benefit_id": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
    "actor_id": "nurse_hiroko",
    "title": "别让她看见",
    "chapter": 1,
    "location_id": "or",
    "trigger_mode": "location",
    "background_id": "operating_room",
    "outfit": "sterile",
    "minutes": 25,
    "teaser": "清醒的年轻患者正紧盯着摆满刀剪的器械台。",
    "time_start": 780,
    "time_end": 1020,
    "priority": 180,
    "category": "contextual",
    "gallery": {
      "cg_id": "hiroko_lv1_or_instrument_panic",
      "caption": "弘子先照顾患者，再教会新人如何看见患者的恐惧。",
      "path": "assets/events/character_events/hiroko/lv1_instrument_lesson.png",
      "show_on_complete": true
    },
    "conditions": {
      "min_day": 2,
      "min_affection": 0,
      "min_familiarity": 0,
      "required_events": [
        "intro_nurse_hiroko",
        "intro_nurse_moe"
      ],
      "special_requirements": [
        {
          "type": "completed_surgeries",
          "minimum": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    "start": "opening",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "opening",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "下午的手术室已经准备得差不多了。无影灯亮着，二十二岁的成年女患者躺在手术台上；手术帽完全包住头发，手术单严密地盖在身上。她还没有进入全身麻醉，目光紧张地在房间里四处游移。\n\n另一边，本庄萌惠正兴致勃勃地整理器械台。金属器械一件接一件排开，在手术灯下反着冷光。",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_opening",
            "label": "看看本庄在忙什么",
            "next": "moe_inventory",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "moe_inventory",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「好……手术刀、剪刀、止血钳、牵开器……这一组也放这里比较顺手。」",
        "expression": "smile",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_moe_inventory",
            "label": "患者叫住了她",
            "next": "patient_question",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "speaker_label": "本庄 萌惠",
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png"
      },
      {
        "id": "patient_question",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "「……护士小姐。」\n\n本庄抬起头：「嗯？」\n\n患者盯着摆得满满的器械台，小声问：「那些……都是等一下要用的吗？」",
        "expression": "worried",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_patient_question",
            "label": "本庄认真地点了点头",
            "next": "moe_explains",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "speaker_label": "成年女患者",
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "moe_explains",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「是啊。你今天这个术式比较大，所以会准备得多一点。刀子会换几把，剪刀也有好几种，这边这些钳子——」",
        "expression": "neutral",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_moe_explains",
            "label": "弘子的声音从身后响起",
            "next": "hiroko_warning",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "speaker_label": "本庄 萌惠",
        "portrait_path": "assets/events/character_events/moe/scrubs_neutral.png"
      },
      {
        "id": "hiroko_warning",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「萌恵。」\n\n患者已经完全移不开视线。她看着一排又一排金属器械，脸色一点点发白。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_hiroko_warning",
            "label": "患者的呼吸突然变得急促",
            "next": "patient_panics",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "patient_panics",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "「等、等等……这些刀子、剪子、钳子，全部都会用在我身上吗？」\n\n本庄毫无恶意地笑着回答：「大部分都会吧。毕竟是开腹手术嘛。」\n\n「萌恵！」\n\n患者猛地想坐起来：「不要！我不要了！我不要做了！」监护仪上的心率骤然往上跳。她慌乱地挣动，手术单随之滑动。",
        "expression": "worried",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_patient_panics",
            "label": "弘子立刻上前",
            "next": "hiroko_covers",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "speaker_label": "成年女患者",
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "hiroko_covers",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "弘子先替患者把露出的部分重新遮严，声音没有提高，却让本庄立刻闭上了嘴。\n\n「萌恵，先别说话。」\n\n「医生，她现在已经没办法靠自己平静下来了。」",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_hiroko_covers",
            "label": "患者的身体忽然僵住",
            "next": "patient_accident",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "patient_accident",
        "speaker": "narrator",
        "text": "患者像是意识到了什么，惊恐瞬间又变成羞耻。\n\n「不、不要看……对不起……我不是故意的……」\n\n手术单下传来一阵窘迫的动静。她因为过度惊恐，在尚未导尿的情况下失禁了。",
        "expression": "worried",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_patient_accident",
            "label": "弘子几乎没有停顿",
            "next": "hiroko_reassures",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ],
        "speaker_label": "成年女患者",
        "hide_portrait": true
      },
      {
        "id": "hiroko_reassures",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "弘子示意拿来干净的垫单，又将患者遮得更严。\n\n「没关系。你没有做错任何事，只是太紧张了。大家都是医护人员，这种情况不是第一次，也绝不会是最后一次。」\n\n「先把这边收拾好。你不用动。」",
        "expression": "warm",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_hiroko_reassures",
            "label": "先帮助患者平静下来",
            "next": "sedation_order",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "sedation_order",
        "speaker": "player",
        "text": "「按术前医嘱给镇静吧。」\n\n弘子确认药物、医嘱与患者信息后，经静脉通路给入术前镇静药。",
        "expression": "focused",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "continue_sedation_order",
            "label": "弘子守在患者身边",
            "next": "look_at_hiroko",
            "effects": {
              "affection": 0,
              "familiarity": 0
            },
            "flags": []
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "look_at_hiroko",
        "speaker": "actor",
        "text": "「会稍微有点困。什么都不用想，慢慢呼吸就好。」\n\n患者仍盯着器械台：「……那些刀子……」\n\n「不要看那边。看着我。」",
        "expression": "warm",
